{
  "name": "a fully remote organisation has no address, adds none, and posts no onsite entry",
  "description": "ADR-0024 decision 12 and the `organization_fully_remote` code.\n\nTiny Studio said at onboarding that it is fully remote. GET …/addresses is where its seats — and its role form — learn that: `workplace: fully_remote`, no addresses, no pending request. It cannot add an address through the owner route (409 organization_fully_remote): its FIRST address is reviewed by a person, and that goes through an office request (orgs/an_office_request_is_reviewed). Its roles are remote-anywhere or remote-in-a-country and nothing else: an onsite entry is refused on create, on a draft's PATCH and on revise, 422 with `field: \"locations\"` and `position`. And it cannot switch to fully remote, because it already is.\n\nAmendment 1 §1.5: a fully remote organisation's onsite entry is refused for being onsite, whatever is wrong with its address — so an entry pointing at an id nobody holds answers `organization_fully_remote`, not `address_not_found`.",
  "seed": ["principals"],
  "steps": [
    {
      "_step": "The kind, from the route a role form already reads.",
      "as": "sam_studio",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "path": "/orgs/01920000-0000-7000-8000-00000000b002/addresses"
      },
      "expect": {
        "status": 200,
        "body": {
          "workplace": "fully_remote",
          "addresses": [],
          "office_request": null
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "_step": "An owner cannot add an address to a fully remote organisation. Its first is reviewed.",
      "as": "sam_studio",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "path": "/orgs/01920000-0000-7000-8000-00000000b002/addresses",
        "body": {
          "country": "ES",
          "city": "Madrid",
          "postal_code": "28013",
          "street1": "Calle Mayor 10",
          "street2": "3rd floor"
        }
      },
      "expect": {
        "status": 409,
        "body": {
          "error": "organization_fully_remote"
        },
        "db": {
          "organization_addresses": {
            "where": {
              "organization_id": "01920000-0000-7000-8000-00000000b002"
            },
            "count": 0
          },
          "organization_office_requests": {
            "where": {
              "organization_id": "01920000-0000-7000-8000-00000000b002"
            },
            "count": 0
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "_step": "Remote is entirely open to it — in two countries where it has no office at all.",
      "as": "sam_studio",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "path": "/org-roles/01920000-0000-7000-8000-00000000b002/roles",
        "body": {
          "title": "Remote designer",
          "engagement": "contract",
          "locations": [
            {
              "mode": "remote",
              "country": "FR"
            },
            {
              "mode": "remote",
              "country": "ES"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "capture": {
        "draft": "$.id"
      },
      "expect": {
        "status": 201,
        "body": {
          "id": "<uuid>",
          "organization_id": "01920000-0000-7000-8000-00000000b002",
          "status": "draft",
          "title": "Remote designer",
          "description": "",
          "engagement": "contract",
          "locations": [
            {
              "mode": "remote",
              "country": "ES",
              "address": null
            },
            {
              "mode": "remote",
              "country": "FR",
              "address": null
            }
          ],
          "currency": "",
          "yearly_ctc": null,
          "yearly_base": null,
          "hourly_rate": null,
          "expected_hours": null,
          "min_office_yoe": null,
          "min_oss_yoe": null,
          "requires_online_test": null,
          "max_interview_rounds": null,
          "avg_days_to_offer": null,
          "questions": [],
          "opened_at": null,
          "close_requested_at": null,
          "closed_at": null,
          "close_reason": null,
          "hires": [],
          "advertised": false,
          "supersedes": null,
          "created_at": "<timestamp>",
          "updated_at": "<timestamp>"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "_step": "An ONSITE entry is refused on create, and the entry is named.",
      "as": "sam_studio",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "path": "/org-roles/01920000-0000-7000-8000-00000000b002/roles",
        "body": {
          "title": "Studio designer",
          "engagement": "contract",
          "locations": [
            {
              "mode": "remote",
              "country": "FR"
            },
            {
              "mode": "onsite",
              "address_id": "01920000-0000-7000-8000-0000000adfff"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "expect": {
        "status": 422,
        "body": {
          "error": "organization_fully_remote",
          "field": "locations",
          "position": 2
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "_step": "...on a draft's PATCH...",
      "as": "sam_studio",
      "request": {
        "method": "PATCH",
        "path": "/org-roles/01920000-0000-7000-8000-00000000b002/roles/{{draft}}",
        "body": {
          "title": "Remote designer",
          "engagement": "contract",
          "locations": [
            {
              "mode": "onsite",
              "address_id": "01920000-0000-7000-8000-0000000adfff"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "expect": {
        "status": 422,
        "body": {
          "error": "organization_fully_remote",
          "field": "locations",
          "position": 1
        },
        "db": {
          "role_locations": {
            "where": {
              "role_id": "{{draft}}"
            },
            "count": 2,
            "all_match": {
              "mode": "remote"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "_step": "...and on revise, which writes no successor.",
      "as": "sam_studio",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "path": "/org-roles/01920000-0000-7000-8000-00000000b002/roles/{{startup.role}}/revise",
        "body": {
          "title": "Backend engineer",
          "engagement": "full_time",
          "locations": [
            {
              "mode": "onsite",
              "address_id": "01920000-0000-7000-8000-0000000adfff"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "expect": {
        "status": 422,
        "body": {
          "error": "organization_fully_remote",
          "field": "locations",
          "position": 1
        },
        "db": {
          "roles": {
            "where": {
              "organization_id": "01920000-0000-7000-8000-00000000b002"
            },
            "count": 2
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "_step": "It cannot go fully remote: it already is.",
      "as": "sam_studio",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "path": "/orgs/01920000-0000-7000-8000-00000000b002/fully-remote"
      },
      "expect": {
        "status": 409,
        "body": {
          "error": "organization_fully_remote"
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
